cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Biology as Code: an open, provenance-tracked toolkit for meal digestion and metabolic-pathway modeling"
abstract: >-
  biology-as-code is an open-source Python package that models what happens to a meal —
  digestion, absorption, and the metabolic pathways it drives — as inspectable code:
  a meal-simulation pipeline, a declarative model of the GI tract as versioned state
  machines, teaching metabolic-pathway graphs, LAW-SPEC law cards as queryable data, and
  an evidence/provenance layer. Built to be fail-closed with no fabricated data. FLOW
  teaching / research software; not medical advice.
type: software
